{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"summary\":\"Built a dependency-free static Quote Board app with local favorite persistence, search, favorites-only filtering, README instructions, and an updated improvement log.\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"final_summary\":\"Implemented the browser-only quote board MVP. Favorite quote IDs are saved in localStorage, search filters by quote text or author, and the favorites-only toggle narrows the board to saved quotes. No implementation bugs were found during validation. Optimizations made: kept the app dependency-free with no build step. Deferred ideas recorded: user-created quotes, import/export, categories, and a denser list view if the quote set grows.\",\"files_changed\":[\"index.html\",\"styles.css\",\"script.js\",\"README.md\",\".head-developer/IMPROVEMENTS.md\"],\"required_files\":[\"index.html\",\"styles.css\",\"script.js\",\"README.md\",\".head-developer/IMPROVEMENTS.md\"],\"validation_commands\":[\"test -f index.html\",\"test -f styles.css\",\"test -f script.js\",\"node --check script.js\",\"test -f README.md\",\"test -f .head-developer/IMPROVEMENTS.md\"],\"docs_updated\":true,\"preview_entry\":\"Open index.html directly in a browser. No dev server is required.\",\"subagents\":[{\"name\":\"Build Static App\",\"responsibility\":\"Create the static quote board UI, persistence behavior, docs, and validation artifacts.\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"changed_files\":[\"index.html\",\"styles.css\",\"script.js\",\"README.md\",\".head-developer/IMPROVEMENTS.md\"],\"validation\":[\"Required file checks passed.\",\"JavaScript syntax check passed.\"],\"summary\":\"Built and validated the dependency-free static quote board.\"},{\"name\":\"Subagent Advisor\",\"responsibility\":\"Assess whether the approved implementation needed multiple logical lanes.\",\"status\":\"skipped\",\"changed_files\":[],\"validation\":[],\"summary\":\"The approved check-in recommended a single direct implementati